{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":4,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the choir director: on the stringed instruments. A Psalm of David","tok":[{"t":"To the choir director: on the stringed instruments. A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[3]}]},{"n":1,"text":"When I call out, answer me, O God of my righteousness; Make room for me when I am in straits; Be gracious to me and hear my prayer.","tok":[{"t":"When I "},{"t":"call","s":["H7121"],"a":[0]},{"t":" out, answer me, O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of my "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; Make room for me when I am in straits; Be gracious to me and "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[8]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"prayer","s":["H8605"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"O sons of men, how long will my glory be made a reproach? How long will you love vanity, will you seek a lie? Selah","tok":[{"t":"O "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0376"],"a":[1]},{"t":", how "},{"t":"long","s":["H5704"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will my "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[4]},{"t":" be made a reproach? How long will you "},{"t":"love","s":["H0157"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"vanity","s":["H7385"],"a":[7]},{"t":", will you "},{"t":"seek","s":["H1245"],"a":[8]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"lie","s":["H3577"],"a":[9]},{"t":"? "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[10]}]},{"n":3,"text":"But know that Jehovah sets apart the faithful man for Himself. Jehovah hears when I call out to Him.","tok":[{"t":"But "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[0]},{"t":" that "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" sets "},{"t":"apart","s":["H6395"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the faithful man for Himself. "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"hears","s":["H8085"],"a":[7]},{"t":" when I "},{"t":"call","s":["H7121"],"a":[8]},{"t":" out to Him."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Be angry, yet do not sin; Consider in your heart upon your bed, And be silent. Selah","tok":[{"t":"Be angry, yet do not "},{"t":"sin","s":["H2398"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; Consider in your "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3824"],"a":[4]},{"t":" upon your "},{"t":"bed","s":["H4904"],"a":[6]},{"t":", And be "},{"t":"silent","s":["H1826"],"a":[7]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[8]}]},{"n":5,"text":"Offer sacrifices of righteousness, And trust in Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"Offer","s":["H2076"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sacrifices","s":["H2077"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"trust","s":["H0982"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Many are those who say, Who will show us any good? Lift up upon us the light of Your countenance, O Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"Many","s":["H7227"],"a":[0]},{"t":" are those who "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":", Who will show us any "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[4]},{"t":"? "},{"t":"Lift","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"up","s":["H5375"],"a":[5]},{"t":" upon us the "},{"t":"light","s":["H0216"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"countenance","s":["H6440"],"a":[8]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"You have put joy in my heart, More than when the grain and new wine of others abound.","tok":[{"t":"You have "},{"t":"put","s":["H5414"],"a":[0]},{"t":" joy in my "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[2]},{"t":", More than when the grain and new "},{"t":"wine","s":["H8492"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of others abound."}]},{"n":8,"text":"In peace I will both lie down and sleep, For You alone, O Jehovah, cause me to dwell in safety.","tok":[{"t":"In "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[0]},{"t":" I will "},{"t":"both","s":["H3162"],"a":[1]},{"t":" lie "},{"t":"down","s":["H7901"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"sleep","s":["H3462"],"a":[3]},{"t":", For You alone, O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":", cause me to "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H3427"],"a":[9]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"safety","s":["H0983"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]}]}
